        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Toxic Relationships",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NEWZEALAND",
        "PublicId": "120064844990",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/sheep/scene_sheep.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 293579a3-b1d9-415a-ad3f-9f876892d9b1).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon, 47.\r\rYour target is Orson Mills; a former CICADA mercanary aswell as Alma Reynard&apos;s lover. Our client, Sean Rose, was involved with Reynard until a couple of days ago, when he found out about the affair between her and Mills. He has contracted the ICA to take care of his &quot;Jealousy&quot;.\rNormally, we don&apos;t take care of personal matters, but since there is already a contract out on Reynard, we might as well take care of Mills. \rWe have tracked them down to New Zealand.\r\rHappy Hunting.",
        "GameVersion": "8.24.0.0",
